{"kind": "mod", "id": 465, "name": "Fontaine's Inspectionless Malfs", "slug": "fontaines-inspectionless-malfs", "teaser": "Makes it so you don't need to inspect/examine malfunctions before clearing them.", "owner_name": "Fontaine", "downloads": 30727, "favourites": 3, "featured": false, "contains_ads": false, "contains_ai_content": false, "cheat_notice": false, "license_name": "Creative Commons BY-NC-SA 3.0", "guid": null, "thumbnail_local": "thumbs/661.jpg", "category": null, "category_id": null, "updated_at": "2026-07-13T18:00:19.000000Z", "created_at": "2022-05-11T19:12:59.000000Z", "published_at": "2022-05-11T19:12:59.000000Z", "latest_constraint": "~3.11.0", "latest_version": "1.4.0", "has_local": false, "has_github": false, "license_link": "http://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-nc-sa/3.0/legalcode", "description_html": "<h3><strong>Inspectionless Malfs:</strong></h3>\n<p>Makes it so you do not need to inspect/examine malfunctions before clearing them. That’s it. Nothing more, nothing less.</p>\n<p>If you want to remove the glow indicators for malfunctions, it’s in the setting’s “Game” tab.</p>\n<p>To install, simply put the .dll file into your BepInEx/Plugins folder</p>\n<h3><strong>Known Issues:</strong></h3>\n<p>If you spam the keybind for clearing malfunctions while reloading while having a malfunction your hands will freeze. Just don’t spam the clear malf keybind while reloading and you’ll never encounter this.</p>\n<p><strong>NOTE: THIS IS ALREADY INCLUDED IN SPT REALISM MOD. DO NOT INSTALL BOTH!</strong></p>\n", "versions": [{"version": "1.2.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.7.1", "content_length": null, "downloads": 5289, "published_at": "2023-10-18T11:07:09.000000Z", "forge_link": "https://forge.sp-tarkov.com/mod/download/465/fontaines-inspectionless-malfs/1.2.0", "github_url": null, "external_url": null, "local_path": null, "fika_compatibility": "unknown", "dependencies": []}, {"version": "1.3.0", "spt_version_constraint": "3.8.0", "content_length": n